  "notes": [
    "Setup: Player A MAIN_PHASE. GD03-054 is in slot1 with no pilot. Player A hand has GD03-094 (X-Rounder pilot) and at least 1 active energy. Player A trash contains 4 (Vagan) cards. Player B has 2 Units with level <= 4.",
    "Action (manual): Player A plays GD03-094 as a pilot onto GD03-054 (PAIRING_COMPLETE).",
    "Expect: Because GD03-094 has trait X-Rounder, GD03-054 pairing effect is available and optional. A TARGET_CHOICE is enqueued to select 4 (Vagan) cards from Player A trash to exile; notificationQueue receives TARGET_CHOICE.",
    "Action (manual): Player A resolves the cost TARGET_CHOICE selecting the 4 Vagan trash cards.",
    "Expect: CARDS_EXILED_FROM_TRASH is appended; then a follow-up TARGET_CHOICE is enqueued to choose an enemy Unit level <= 4 to destroy (notificationQueue receives TARGET_CHOICE).",
    "Action (manual): Player A resolves the follow-up TARGET_CHOICE selecting Player B slot2 unit.",
    "Expect: Selected enemy unit is destroyed (UNIT_DESTROYED_BY_EFFECT)."
  ],
